cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Please contribute your findings about the Catch-Up conjecture to this repository.
  Proofs, partial results, computations, failed approaches, and research notes are
  all welcome—you do not need to solve the conjecture to make a useful contribution.
  When submitting a contribution, please also add your name to the repository’s
  citation in the README and to this CITATION.cff file, so you can be credited.
  This is a shared research effort, and the author list should grow with the project.
title: "Catch-Up Research Repository"
authors:
  - family-names: "Cowgill"
    given-names: "Bo"
url: "https://github.com/bocowgill-collaborations/catch-up-research"
